"biodiversity contributes to meeting global conservation targets. PLoS One "
"7(3): e32529 "
"(<http://journals.plos.org/plosone/article?id=10.1371/journal.pone.0032529>)."
msgstr "Butchart, S. H. M. et al. (2012). Protecting important sites for biodiversity contributes to meeting global conservation targets. PLoS One 7(3): e32529 (<http://journals.plos.org/plosone/article?id=10.1371/journal.pone.0032529>)."

