msgid ""
"Eken, G. et al. (2004). Key biodiversity areas as site conservation targets."
" BioScience 54: 1110–1118 "
"(<http://bioscience.oxfordjournals.org/content/54/12/1110.short>)."
msgstr "Eken, G. et al. (2004). Key biodiversity areas as site conservation targets. BioScience 54: 1110–1118 (<http://bioscience.oxfordjournals.org/content/54/12/1110.short>)."

#: ../../SO4.md:196
