msgstr "IUCN (2016). A Global Standard for the Identification of Key Biodiversity Areas. International Union for Conservation of Nature, Gland, Switzerland (<https://portals.iucn.org/library/node/46259>)."

#: ../../SO4.md:198
msgid ""
