"biodiversity. Bird Conservation International. 29:177–198."
msgstr "Donald, P. et al. (2018) Important Bird and Biodiversity Areas (IBAs): the development and characteristics of a global inventory of key sites for biodiversity. Bird Conservation International. 29:177–198."

#: ../../SO4.md:200
msgid ""
"Ricketts, T. H. et al. (2005). Pinpointing and preventing imminent "
"extinctions. Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences of the U.S.A. "
"102: 18497–18501 (<http://www.pnas.org/content/102/51/18497.short>)."
